From f1dda932638819c8e91a0594d2f025befe77c51d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:06:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Bundle XD desktop team-save and VS-mode templates

Ship the XD Netplay launcher's seed files in Sys/XDNetplay:

- EMERALD-2.sav / EMERALD-3.sav: pre-built Emerald team saves for GBA
  ports 2 and 3, copied next to the imported Emerald dump on first
  install (existing saves are never overwritten).
- 01-GXXE-PokemonXD.gci: an XD save positioned at VS mode, seeded into
  GC memory card A's USA directory so a fresh install can jump straight
  into link battles.

These mirror the Android build's bundled assets and the proven
desktop-portable package.
